+Vendored dart-lang/native packages for the ppc64 port of flutter_tools
+======================================================================
+
+flutter_tools 3.41.9 pins these exact versions in its pubspec.yaml, and
+packages/flutter_tools/pubspec.yaml points dependency_overrides here:
+
+  package       version  pub.dev archive sha256                                             upstream tag (dart-lang/native)
+  code_assets   1.0.0    83ccdaa064c980b5596c35dd64a8d3ecc68620174ab9b90b6343b753aa721687   hooks_runner-v1.0.1 (93039d7), pkgs/code_assets
+  hooks_runner  1.0.1    87832cd552d8ddc6014c240ee724f37bc9ea5141aa74a21658b73d22358f43fd   hooks_runner-v1.0.1 (93039d7), pkgs/hooks_runner
+
+Each directory holds lib/, pubspec.yaml, LICENSE, README.md and CHANGELOG.md
+from the pub.dev archive, unmodified except by the patch named below. The
+archive's lib/ is identical to the tag's.
+
+Local change: the dart-lang/native patch "Add Architecture.ppc64 and the
+linux_ppc64 target", applied with -p3 to each package directory. It is
+written to go upstream unchanged.
+
+To update: replace a directory with the pinned version's archive contents,
+then re-apply that patch.
